IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. CONTROLCASE.
DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01 N PIC 9. 01 I PIC 9. 01 FLAG PIC X. 88 YES VALUE 'Y'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
ACCEPT N ACCEPT FLAG
IF (N >= 1 AND YES) OR N = 0 DISPLAY 'TRUE' ELSE DISPLAY 'FALSE' END-IF
EVALUATE N WHEN 0 DISPLAY 'ZERO' WHEN 1 DISPLAY 'ONE' WHEN OTHER DISPLAY 'OTHER' END-EVALUATE
PERFORM N TIMES ADD 1 TO I END-PERFORM
GOBACK.
